class_name RoomTemplates
extends RefCounted
## Room layouts as text. Each layout is the 28 x 14 INTERIOR of a room;
## walls and doors are added automatically by room.gd.
##
##   .  floor      R  rock      P  pillar      C  crate      S  enemy spawn point
##
## Rules when you add a layout (copy one and edit it):
##   - exactly 14 rows of exactly 28 characters
##   - keep the door lanes clear: columns 12-15 in rows 0-3 and 10-13,
##     and columns 0-3 / 24-27 in rows 5-8
##   - give combat layouts 6-10 S markers, not right next to the door lanes

